{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw Boomerang like a legend and shoot Pistol with John Wick precision in this immersive VR game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless combat waves, tackle powerful enemy bosses, solve puzzles, and stay alive by managing your hunger and thirst as you race against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/44cd7e3aab5063f9d654e8dd7af2317b.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1560 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fur of Ko-Archie, a small-town koala with big dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/6a47509234cb9260961ed2d8f3967039.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1200 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a dazzling victory at the International Cooking Show, the Koala Chef siblings\u2014Ko-Archie and Ko-Emily\u2014thought their culinary adventure had reached its peak. But fame comes with a price. When the sinister vampire Brutus and his shadowy assistant Bones kidnap Ko-Emily, demanding the family\u2019s secret recipes as ransom, Ko-Archie faces an impossible race against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/1ab9d71a87e020aa3e1fee05d7e12093.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1200 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the city out of reach and every second ticking down, Ko-Archie turns to the eccentric Professor (or Grandpa, as he\u2019s respectfully known) and his experimental Teleport Machine. The plan? A daring rescue. The reality? Teleportation gone haywire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/f8d69371ca76726dfc732005d696a61d.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1200 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catapulted across bizarre worlds and unexpected eras, you\u2019ll fight, puzzle-solve, and survive through wild environments\u2014from neon-lit cityscapes to haunted ruins, enchanted forests, and beyond. Face fiendish foes, outwit cunning bosses, and discover the hidden secrets of each realm\u2014all while racing to find your sister before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/c68d3fc8e9d33e670bcf1179cd86d832.poster.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1200 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/c68d3fc8e9d33e670bcf1179cd86d832.webm?t=1756963837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you master the chaos of the teleporter, overcome Brutus\u2019 sinister traps, and reunite the Koala Chef siblings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The kitchen has never been this wild.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a whirlwind VR adventure through ever-changing worlds and timelines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter creative enemies and boss battles that challenge your wits and reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique settings and surprises every time you play\u2014no two journeys are alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the power of family, courage, and a really good recipe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to jump,  and fight your way through the unknown? The adventure of a lifetime awaits\u2014step into the chaos and prove you have what it takes to save Ko-Emily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The clock is ticking. The chef\u2019s hat is yours. The rest is up to you\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827710?t=1756963837","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827710?t=1756963837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/76b4680a306ea9aeecfe00b6cd4790be14615ac8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756963837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/76b4680a306ea9aeecfe00b6cd4790be14615ac8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756963837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Throw Boomerang like a legend and shoot Pistol with John Wick precision in this immersive VR game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless combat waves, tackle powerful enemy bosses, solve puzzles, and stay alive by managing your hunger and thirst as you race against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/44cd7e3aab5063f9d654e8dd7af2317b.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1560 height=378 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the fur of Ko-Archie, a small-town koala with big dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/6a47509234cb9260961ed2d8f3967039.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1200 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a dazzling victory at the International Cooking Show, the Koala Chef siblings\u2014Ko-Archie and Ko-Emily\u2014thought their culinary adventure had reached its peak. But fame comes with a price. When the sinister vampire Brutus and his shadowy assistant Bones kidnap Ko-Emily, demanding the family\u2019s secret recipes as ransom, Ko-Archie faces an impossible race against time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/1ab9d71a87e020aa3e1fee05d7e12093.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1200 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the city out of reach and every second ticking down, Ko-Archie turns to the eccentric Professor (or Grandpa, as he\u2019s respectfully known) and his experimental Teleport Machine. The plan? A daring rescue. The reality? Teleportation gone haywire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/f8d69371ca76726dfc732005d696a61d.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1200 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catapulted across bizarre worlds and unexpected eras, you\u2019ll fight, puzzle-solve, and survive through wild environments\u2014from neon-lit cityscapes to haunted ruins, enchanted forests, and beyond. Face fiendish foes, outwit cunning bosses, and discover the hidden secrets of each realm\u2014all while racing to find your sister before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/c68d3fc8e9d33e670bcf1179cd86d832.poster.avif?t=1756963837\" width=1200 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/extras/c68d3fc8e9d33e670bcf1179cd86d832.webm?t=1756963837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you master the chaos of the teleporter, overcome Brutus\u2019 sinister traps, and reunite the Koala Chef siblings?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The kitchen has never been this wild.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a whirlwind VR adventure through ever-changing worlds and timelines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter creative enemies and boss battles that challenge your wits and reflexes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique settings and surprises every time you play\u2014no two journeys are alike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the power of family, courage, and a really good recipe</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to jump,  and fight your way through the unknown? The adventure of a lifetime awaits\u2014step into the chaos and prove you have what it takes to save Ko-Emily!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The clock is ticking. The chef\u2019s hat is yours. The rest is up to you\u2026</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Artwork Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827710/2945872b9973235821d96b951ae5cde22e9170fc/header.jpg?t=1756963837","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Artwork Game and VR Production Pty Ltd. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nKo-Archie: Eeny Meeny Miny Moe\u2122 and all related logos are trademarks of Artwork Game and VR Production Pty Ltd.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3827710/703235962/1115bbc091381acb8e728ca650b9e2c8ef2f3b85/1754449322/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754689453",